                                                "sense_id": "749acf12-c7b6-3fa3-895c-6f989b86b041",
                                                "text": "The books say it's normal. Toddlers often stop napping around this age, and the average amount of sleep needed by a two-year-old is between nine and thirteen hours. My kiddo cuts logs for twelve hours at a stretch, so she's plenty rested."
